Magister_CIV4GameText_FFH2.xml	TXT_KEY_RELIGION_HOUSE_OF_PLENTY_PEDIA	Deep with the richest areas of the world (and only those areas) great temples to Amathaon provide rest and an endless bounty to those that would join them. They are less about worship and more about providing hospitality, like the world's best bed and breakfast. Often called the Lord of Plenty. \r\n\t\t\r\n[PARAGRAPH:3]Priests and Angels of [LINK=RELIGION_HOUSE_OF_PLENTY]The House of Plenty[\\LINK] will have their ardas most strengthened by the influence of [LINK=RELIGION_HOUSE_OF_PLENTY]The House of Plenty[\\LINK], but also strengthened to a lesser degree by [LINK=RELIGION_RINGGIVER]The Ringgivers[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_THE_EMPYREAN]The Empyrean[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_BROTHERHOOD_OF_WARDENS]The Brotherhood of Wardens[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_UNBLEMISHED]The Unblemished[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_FOXMEN]The Foxmen[\\LINK], The [LINK=RELIGION_RUNES_OF_KILMORPH]The Runes of Kilmorph[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_LAERAN_CORD]The Laeran Cord[\\LINK], and [LINK=RELIGION_FELLOWSHIP_OF_LEAVES]The Fellowship of the Leaves[\\LINK]. Its arda will be weakened by [LINK=RELIGION_CHILDREN_OF_THE_ONE]The Children of The One[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_MATRONAE]The Matronae[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_THE_ASHEN_VEIL]The Ashen Veil[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_GREY_COUNCIL]The Grey Council[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_COVEN]The Between[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_EMBER_LEGION]The Ember Legion[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_ANOINTED]The Anointed[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_SONS_OF_DISCORD]The Sons of Discord[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_STEWARDS_OF_INEQUITY]The Stewards of Inequity[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_WHITE_HAND]The White Hand[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_COUNCIL_OF_ESUS]The Council of Esus[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_OCTOPUS_OVERLORDS]The Undertow[\\LINK], [LINK=RELIGION_CULT_OF_THE_DRAGON]Cult of the Dragon[\\LINK], and [LINK=RELIGION_THE_EMPYREAN]The Order[\\LINK]. It will be strengthened in Good lands and weakened in Evil lands. It will be strengthened by proximity to [LINK=BONUS_MANA_CREATION]Creation Mana[\\LINK], [LINK=IMPROVEMENT_MAJENS_WORKSHOP]Majen's Worskshop[\\LINK], [LINK=IMPROVEMENT_ENCLAVEL]Enclaves[\\LINK], [LINK=IMPROVEMENT_CITADEL]Citadels[\\LINK], [LINK=IMPROVEMENT_WORKSHOP]Workshops[\\LINK], [LINK=FEATURE_FOREST_NEW]New Forests[\\LINK], or [LINK=FEATURE_HALLOWED_GROUND]Hallowed Ground[\\LINK]. It is weakened by [LINK=BONUS_MANA_ENTROPY]Entropy Mana[\\LINK].	
